>>__ load "simpExtLib";
>>__ Parse.temp_set_grammars $ valOf $ grammarDB {thyname="hol"};
## `set_unsafe_solvers`

``` hol4
simpExtLib.set_unsafe_solvers : TraverseExt.ssolver list ->
  simpExtLib.simpset -> simpExtLib.simpset
```

------------------------------------------------------------------------

Replaces the unsafe solver list, retaining only the first solver of each
name. The safe list is unchanged.

### Failure

Never fails.

### Example

``` hol4
>>_ val ext_bool_ss = simpExtLib.lift_simpset boolSimps.bool_ss;
>>_ val ss = simpExtLib.add_unsafe_solver
     (simpExtLib.mk_tactic_solver ("decide", DECIDE_TAC))
     ext_bool_ss;
>>_ val no_unsafe_solvers = simpExtLib.set_unsafe_solvers [] ss;
```

### See also

[`simpExtLib.add_unsafe_solver`](#simpExtLib.add_unsafe_solver),
[`simpExtLib.set_safe_solvers`](#simpExtLib.set_safe_solvers).
